# SagaDrive

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) before changing code.

## Stack

- React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind + Radix
- Supabase self-host (Auth, Postgres, Edge Functions, Storage)
- UI/errors Deutsch; commits and PR text English
- Quality gate: `npm run test-gate` (includes architecture-boundary-check)

## Architecture (#94)

- `src/domains/**` — pure business/rules (no React, no Supabase)
- `src/infrastructure/**` — Supabase / network adapters only
- `src/app/<domain>/<slice>/` — vertical user journeys
- `src/modules/**` — legacy barrels; no new business logic for migrated areas
- Character: `edit/` is composition root; consume `creation/` + `progression/` via public barrels only

## Workflow

- Issue branches from `main` — never commit directly to `main`
- Acceptance: `.qa/acceptance/<slug>.md` when present
- Composition proof: `.qa/runs/composition-gate-<slug>.md` (CLEAR/SKIPPED for current HEAD)
- Ship only after `@ecc-check` READY / green CI

## Security

- Owner-scoped data stays owner-scoped (RLS + service checks)
- Client writes must not invent elevated origins or cross-owner FKs
- Security reviews list **all** severities including Low/Info
